# AK_Forest_LARP
# Fantasy woodland grade. Rolls harsh yellow-green foliage toward a deeper cinematic green, cools the shadows, and protects skin tones so faces stay warm against the forest.
# Best for: Outdoor LARP, woodland, costume and character work under tree cover.
# Apply AFTER a D-Log M -> Rec.709 conversion, not instead of one.
